@api = http://localhost:5102

### Catálogo público de la tienda verde
GET {{api}}/api/store/catalog?category=Perfumes
X-Tenant: verde

### Token del administrador de la tienda verde
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/token
X-Tenant: verde
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@verde.local", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Pedidos pendientes de validación de pago
GET {{api}}/api/admin/orders?status=PendingPaymentValidation
X-Tenant: verde
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Token del Super Admin (host admin.localhost)
# @name superlogin
POST {{api}}/api/auth/token
Host: admin.localhost:5102
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "superadmin@cgshop.local", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Crear empresa con color primario obligatorio
POST {{api}}/api/superadmin/tenants
Host: admin.localhost:5102
Authorization: Bearer {{superlogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tienda Azul",
  "slug": "azul",
  "primaryColor": "#1565C0",
  "adminFullName": "Dueño Azul",
  "adminEmail": "admin@azul.local",
  "adminPassword": "Admin123!"
}
